# ── Supabase ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Create a free project at https://supabase.com, then copy these from
# Project Settings → API. Paste into .env.local (never commit .env.local).
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR-PROJECT-REF.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=YOUR-ANON-KEY

# Server-only — used by admin tasks / seeding. NEVER prefix with NEXT_PUBLIC_
# and never commit the real value anywhere (this file included).
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=YOUR-SERVICE-ROLE-KEY

# ── Face verification service (optional hardening — FastAPI + DeepFace) ─
# Leave unset: in-browser descriptor capture + server-side matching is used.
# When set, enrolment computes a server-side DeepFace embedding from the
# captured frame and mark-attendance re-verifies the live image server-side
# (raw pixels re-embedded there). The service lives in ./face-service — see
# face-service/README.md to run or deploy it.
# FACE_SERVICE_URL=https://your-face-service.onrender.com
#
# Shared secret — must equal FACE_SERVICE_TOKEN set on the face service. Sent
# as the X-Face-Service-Token header. Leave blank only if the service has none.
# FACE_SERVICE_TOKEN=

# ── Twilio parent SMS (Supabase Edge Function) ───────────────────────
# These are NOT app env vars — they are secrets for the notify-shortfall
# edge function, set with `supabase secrets set …` (see
# supabase/functions/notify-shortfall/README.md). Listed here for reference.
# TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID=
# TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN=
# TWILIO_FROM_NUMBER=+1XXXXXXXXXX
# For India (TRAI/DLT), send via a Messaging Service bound to a DLT sender:
# TWILIO_MESSAGING_SERVICE_SID=MGxxxxxxxx
